  "title": "China Lost Control of Two Panama Canal Ports. But Who Actually Won?",
  "deck": "Panama replaced a Hong Kong-linked operator at Balboa and Cristóbal. Nine-month data show both ports lost container traffic while the national system grew. The economic winners are not necessarily the strategic winners.",
